llhttp
https://github.com/nodejs/llhttp

chez-httparse is a port of llhttp's HTTP/1 parser. The grammars in
src/httparse/grammar.sls and src/httparse/url-grammar.sls follow llhttp's
state machine; src/httparse/methods.sls, modes.sls and decisions.sls carry
its method table, mode numbering and connection rules; and the error codes
and reason strings are llhttp's. The generated parsers in src/generated/ are
emitted from these sources.

The conformance corpus under test/vendor/llhttp/ is llhttp's test data,
vendored unmodified. It is used only by the test suite and is not part of
the library.

